# `AIT`

Algorithmic information theory.

Kolmogorov complexity in its plain, bit-length, time-bounded and prefix forms, prefix machines
and their Kraft–Chaitin and Kraft-minimality constructions, algorithmic probability and the
coding theorem, the Elias bound, the halting probability, prefix counting and model cost, and
